these are NetHack's art and keep their own terms.

nethack/glyphs.png, nethack/glyphs.json
  The NetHack 3.6 tileset as MiniHack ships it (minihack/tiles/tiles.pkl and glyph2tile,
  https://github.com/facebookresearch/minihack), exported as a sprite sheet by
  tools/tiles_export.py. The tiles are NetHack's (win/share/*.txt), distributed under the
  NetHack General Public License (https://www.nethack.org/common/license.html).

editor/, index.json
  The named icons of the MiniHack Level Editor (https://github.com/minihack-editor/minihack-editor.github.io,
  whose code is Apache-2.0), scraped by its authors from NetHackWiki (https://nethackwiki.com).
  NetHackWiki publishes NetHack-derived images under the NetHack General Public License and its
  other content under CC BY-SA 3.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/). Each
  index.json entry keeps its NetHackWiki page as `source`. index.json is derived from the
  editor's src/tilesets/nethack/*.json by tools/tiles_export.py.
